{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35156","headline":"诗品二十四则 豪放 · 司空图","name":"诗品二十四则 豪放","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"观花匪禁，吞吐大荒。\n由道返气，处得以狂。\n天风浪浪，海山苍苍。\n真力弥满，万象在旁。\n前招三辰，後引凤皇。\n晓策六鳌，濯足扶桑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空图","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}